# Root lockfile IS tracked. It was previously ignored, which let the root
# `vitest` range ^4.0.7 float to 4.0.18 — incompatible with
# vitest-environment-clarinet, so the Clarity suite silently ran zero
# tests. frontend/ pinned its own lockfile and stayed on 3.2.4, which is
# why only the contract tests broke. Committing this pins the toolchain
# and lets CI use `npm ci`.

# Environment secrets (never commit)
.env
